#: ../../jlavi.rst:1
msgid "Configuring Sibuna with Jlavi"
msgstr "إعداد Sibuna بلغة Jlavi"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:4
msgid ""
"Jlavi is Sibuna's configuration language. We use it to describe the "
"topology that Sibuna should serve. At startup or reload, Sibuna evaluates "
"one JLV/2 module and validates its result with the same schema as a JSON "
"configuration. Workers use the resulting routes for subsequent traffic."
msgstr ""
"Jlavi هي لغة إعداد Sibuna. نصف بها طوبولوجيا الشبكة التي نريد أن يخدمها "
"Sibuna. عند بدء التشغيل أو إعادة التحميل يقيّم Sibuna وحدة JLV/2 واحدة "
"ويتحقق من نتيجتها بالمخطط نفسه الذي يستخدمه لإعداد JSON. تستخدم خيوط "
"العمل المسارات الناتجة لحركة البيانات اللاحقة."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:6
msgid ""
"We try each complete example in its own working directory. We stop the "
"running example before starting another that uses the same port."
msgstr ""
"نجرب كل مثال مكتمل في دليل عمل خاص به. ونوقف المثال الجاري قبل بدء مثال "
"آخر يستخدم المنفذ نفسه."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:8
msgid "Read the language"
msgstr "قراءة اللغة"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:11
msgid ""
"Source files use UTF-8. An identifier starts with an ASCII letter or "
"underscore and can then contain digits. A newline ends a statement. Lists "
"and records can span lines. Double quotes delimit text. A line comment "
"starts with two slashes. A block comment runs from ``/*`` to ``*/`` and "
"cannot nest."
msgstr ""
"تستخدم الملفات ترميز UTF-8. يبدأ المعرّف بحرف ASCII أو شرطة سفلية، ويمكن "
"أن تتبعه أرقام. ينهي السطر الجديد العبارة. وقد تمتد القوائم والسجلات على "
"عدة أسطر. نضع النص بين علامتي اقتباس مزدوجتين. تبدأ تعليقات السطر بشرطتين "
"مائلتين. ويمتد تعليق الكتلة من ``/*`` إلى ``*/`` ولا يقبل التداخل."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:13
msgid ""
"We start with a function. Its parameters have types. The type after "
"``->`` describes its result. We can put this helper above the entry point "
"in the same file."
msgstr ""
"نبدأ بدالة. لكل معامل نوع. يبيّن النوع الذي يلي ``->`` نوع النتيجة. "
"يمكننا كتابة هذه الدالة المساعدة قبل دالة الدخول في الملف نفسه."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:15
msgid ""
"fn address(host: Text, port: Int) -> Text {\n"
"    return \"${host}:${port}\"\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn address(host: Text, port: Int) -> Text {\n"
"    return \"${host}:${port}\"\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:21
msgid ""
"The call ``address(\"127.0.0.1\", 9000)`` returns ``\"127.0.0.1:9000\"``. "
"Inside a string, ``${...}`` inserts the value of the enclosed expression. "
"A helper constructs data. Sibuna opens listeners only when it serves the "
"resulting configuration."
msgstr ""
"يعيد الاستدعاء ``address(\"127.0.0.1\", 9000)`` النص "
"``\"127.0.0.1:9000\"``. داخل سلسلة نصية تحل قيمة التعبير المحصور بين "
"القوسين محل ``${...}``. تبني الدالة المساعدة بيانات الإعداد. ويفتح Sibuna "
"منافذ الاستماع عند بدء تقديم الخدمة وفق الإعداد الناتج."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:23
msgid ""
"Sibuna calls ``edge()`` with no arguments. Its result type is "
"``Map<Value>``. The keys are text. The values can have different types, "
"so one map can hold a list of bind addresses beside a boolean switch. A "
"list preserves order. For HTTP routes this matters because Sibuna uses "
"the first matching route."
msgstr ""
"يستدعي Sibuna الدالة ``edge()`` بلا وسائط. نوع النتيجة هو ``Map<Value>``. "
"المفاتيح نصوص، ويمكن أن تختلف أنواع القيم. وهكذا نستطيع وضع قائمة عناوين "
"الاستماع وقيمة منطقية في الخريطة نفسها. تحافظ القائمة على ترتيب عناصرها. "
"وهذا مهم لمسارات HTTP لأن Sibuna يختار أول مسار مطابق."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:25
msgid ""
"A colon separates a field name from its value. Commas separate fields and "
"list elements. A trailing comma is allowed. Write a port as part of the "
"quoted bind address, a connection limit as a decimal integer and a switch "
"such as http3 as true or false."
msgstr ""
"تفصل النقطتان اسم الحقل عن قيمته. ونفصل الحقول وعناصر القوائم بفواصل، "
"ويمكن وضع فاصلة بعد العنصر الأخير. نكتب المنفذ ضمن عنوان الاستماع المحاط "
"بعلامتي اقتباس، وحد الاتصالات كعدد صحيح عشري، ومفتاحا مثل http3 بالقيمة "
"true أو false."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:27
msgid "Build a web pool"
msgstr "إنشاء مجموعة خوادم ويب"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:30
msgid ""
"We can now describe the two timetable servers from :doc:`introduction` in "
"a file. We save this module as ``edge.jlv``. A frontend listens on port "
"8080. Its ``default_backend`` names the timetable pool. The shield "
"inspects HTTP requests, and the pool distributes admitted requests "
"between two replicas."
msgstr ""
"يمكننا الآن أن نصف خادمي المواعيد اللذين تعرفنا عليهما في "
":doc:`introduction` ضمن ملف. نحفظ الوحدة باسم ``edge.jlv``. تستمع الواجهة "
"الأمامية على المنفذ 8080، ويحدد ``default_backend`` مجموعة timetable. "
"يفحص shield طلبات HTTP ثم توزّع المجموعة الطلبات المقبولة بين نسختين."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:32
msgid ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    let hosts = [\"127.0.0.1\", \"127.0.0.2\"]\n"
"    return {\n"
"        http: { surface: \"shield\" },\n"
"        frontends: { web: { binds: [\"127.0.0.1:8080\"], default_backend: "
"\"timetable\" } },\n"
"        backends: { timetable: { servers: [for host in hosts: "
"\"${host}:9000\"] } },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    let hosts = [\"127.0.0.1\", \"127.0.0.2\"]\n"
"    return {\n"
"        http: { surface: \"shield\" },\n"
"        frontends: { web: { binds: [\"127.0.0.1:8080\"], default_backend: "
"\"timetable\" } },\n"
"        backends: { timetable: { servers: [for host in hosts: "
"\"${host}:9000\"] } },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:43
msgid ""
"The binding ``let hosts`` gives the list a name for the rest of the "
"function. Its value stays fixed. The expression ``[for host in hosts: "
"\"${host}:9000\"]`` makes one server address per host in list order. We "
"could write ``address(host, 9000)`` there if we included the helper above."
msgstr ""
"نسمّي القائمة باستخدام ``let hosts`` لنشير إليها بهذا الاسم في بقية "
"الدالة. وتظل قيمتها ثابتة. ينشئ التعبير ``[for host in hosts: "
"\"${host}:9000\"]`` عنوان خادم لكل مضيف بحسب ترتيب القائمة. وإذا أضفنا "
"الدالة المساعدة السابقة أمكننا كتابة ``address(host, 9000)`` في ذلك "
"الموضع."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:45
msgid ""
"We check the module before opening the listener. To generate a module "
"from a working ``sibuna lb`` command we add ``--print-config`` to that "
"command."
msgstr ""
"نتحقق من الوحدة قبل فتح منفذ الاستماع. ولتوليد وحدة من أمر ``sibuna lb`` "
"سبق أن شغّلناه بنجاح، نضيف ``--print-config`` إلى ذلك الأمر."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:47
msgid ""
"sibuna check -f edge.jlv\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv"
msgstr ""
"sibuna check -f edge.jlv\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:52
msgid "Name replicas with a helper"
msgstr "تسمية النسخ بدالة مساعدة"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:55
msgid ""
"When replicas have names and weights, we can build each server record "
"with the same function. We add the import at the top of the module and "
"the helper before ``edge()``. The condition takes a boolean. The imported "
"text library converts the name to lowercase."
msgstr ""
"عندما يكون لكل نسخة اسم ووزن، يمكننا بناء سجل كل خادم بالدالة نفسها. نكتب "
"تعليمة الاستيراد في أول الوحدة والدالة المساعدة قبل ``edge()``. يأخذ "
"الشرط قيمة منطقية. وتحوّل مكتبة النصوص المستوردة حروف الاسم إلى حروف "
"صغيرة."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:57
msgid ""
"import { text } from jlv.std.foundation\n"
"\n"
"fn replica(label: Text, address: Text, primary: Bool) -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    let name = text.lower(label)\n"
"    if primary {\n"
"        return { name: name, addr: address, weight: 2 }\n"
"    }\n"
"    return { name: name, addr: address, weight: 1 }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"import { text } from jlv.std.foundation\n"
"\n"
"fn replica(label: Text, address: Text, primary: Bool) -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    let name = text.lower(label)\n"
"    if primary {\n"
"        return { name: name, addr: address, weight: 2 }\n"
"    }\n"
"    return { name: name, addr: address, weight: 1 }\n"
"}"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:69
msgid ""
"In the first timetable pool we can replace the entire ``servers`` list "
"with the expression below. Evaluating it produces two records that Sibuna "
"can validate before it contacts either server."
msgstr ""
"في مجموعة جدول المواعيد الأولى يمكننا استبدال قائمة ``servers`` كاملة "
"بالتعبير التالي. ينتج عن تقييمه سجلان يستطيع Sibuna التحقق منهما قبل "
"الاتصال بأي من الخادمين."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:71
msgid ""
"[replica(\"East\", \"127.0.0.1:9000\", true), replica(\"West\", "
"\"127.0.0.2:9000\", false)]"
msgstr ""
"[replica(\"East\", \"127.0.0.1:9000\", true), replica(\"West\", "
"\"127.0.0.2:9000\", false)]"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:75
msgid "Serve and observe a protected application"
msgstr "تشغيل تطبيق محمي ومراقبته"

#: ../../jlavi.rst:78
msgid ""
"We save the following module as ``station.jlv``. We give the timetable a "
"health check and twice as much weight on the first replica. A request "
"must carry the station header to pass our request hook. The firewall "
"checks it first. The separate connection hook asks a local agent about "
"new connections on the staff frontend only."
msgstr ""
"نحفظ الوحدة التالية باسم ``station.jlv``. نضبط فحص صحة لخدمة جدول "
"المواعيد ونعطي النسخة الأولى ضعف وزن الثانية. يفحص الجدار الناري الطلب "
"أولا، ثم يشترط خطاف الطلب وجود ترويسة المحطة. وفي واجهة الموظفين وحدها "
"يستشير خطاف اتصال مستقل وكيلا محليا بشأن الاتصالات الجديدة."

#: ../../jlavi.rst:80
msgid ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: {\n"
"            max_flows: 4096, workers: 2, admin_socket: \"edge.sock\",\n"
"            watch: \"5s\", shutdown_timeout: \"10s\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        http: {\n"
"            surface: \"shield\", policy_file: \"policy.json\", "
"secret_file: \"http.key\",\n"
"            rate_limit: 120, rate_window: \"10s\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        plugins: {\n"
"            station: { kind: \"native\", hook: \"require_header\", "
"settings: { name: \"x-station\" } },\n"
"            staff: { kind: \"agent\", socket: \"staff.sock\", deadline: "
"\"5ms\", on_failure: \"deny\" },\n"
"        },\n"
"        hook_judges: { threads: 2, queue: 64 },\n"
"        frontends: {\n"
"            web: {\n"
"                binds: [\"127.0.0.1:8080\"], default_backend: "
"\"timetable\",\n"
"                max_body: \"64k\", hooks: { request: [\"station\"] },\n"
"            },\n"
"            staff: {\n"
"                binds: [\"127.0.0.1:8081\"], default_backend: "
"\"timetable\",\n"
"                hooks: { connection: [\"staff\"], request: [\"station\"] "
"},\n"
"            },\n"
"        },\n"
"        backends: { timetable: {\n"
"            balance: { kind: \"round_robin\" },\n"
"            health_check: { kind: \"http\", path: \"/healthz\", "
"expect_status: 200 },\n"
"            connect_timeout: \"2s\", response_timeout: \"10s\", retries: "
"1,\n"
"            servers: [\n"
"                { name: \"east\", addr: \"127.0.0.1:9000\", weight: 2 },\n"
"                { name: \"west\", addr: \"127.0.0.2:9000\", weight: 1 },\n"
"            ],\n"
"        } },\n"
"        observability: { access_log: { output: \"stderr\" }, listen: "
"\"127.0.0.1:9100\" },\n"
"        console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: "
"\"console-data\", node: 1 },\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"fn edge() -> Map<Value> {\n"
"    return {\n"
"        global: {\n"
"            max_flows: 4096, workers: 2, admin_socket: \"edge.sock\",\n"
"            watch: \"5s\", shutdown_timeout: \"10s\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        http: {\n"
"            surface: \"shield\", policy_file: \"policy.json\", "
"secret_file: \"http.key\",\n"
"            rate_limit: 120, rate_window: \"10s\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        plugins: {\n"
"            station: { kind: \"native\", hook: \"require_header\", "
"settings: { name: \"x-station\" } },\n"
"            staff: { kind: \"agent\", socket: \"staff.sock\", deadline: "
"\"5ms\", on_failure: \"deny\" },\n"
"        },\n"
"        hook_judges: { threads: 2, queue: 64 },\n"
"        frontends: {\n"
"            web: {\n"
"                binds: [\"127.0.0.1:8080\"], default_backend: "
"\"timetable\",\n"
"                max_body: \"64k\", hooks: { request: [\"station\"] },\n"
"            },\n"
"            staff: {\n"
"                binds: [\"127.0.0.1:8081\"], default_backend: "
"\"timetable\",\n"
"                hooks: { connection: [\"staff\"], request: [\"station\"] "
"},\n"
"            },\n"
"        },\n"
"        backends: { timetable: {\n"
"            balance: { kind: \"round_robin\" },\n"
"            health_check: { kind: \"http\", path: \"/healthz\", "
"expect_status: 200 },\n"
"            connect_timeout: \"2s\", response_timeout: \"10s\", retries: "
"1,\n"
"            servers: [\n"
"                { name: \"east\", addr: \"127.0.0.1:9000\", weight: 2 },\n"
"                { name: \"west\", addr: \"127.0.0.2:9000\", weight: 1 },\n"
"            ],\n"
"        } },\n"
"        observability: { access_log: { output: \"stderr\" }, listen: "
